+# Generate an HTTP transcript
+
+```bash
+tram api-tests.json --transcript transcript.http
+```
+
+This generates a cURL-like transcript of the observed HTTP conversation, including resolved requests, responses, and capture values. Assertion pass/fail details remain in the report output.
+
+Only successfully validated manifests generate HTTP transcripts.
+
+---
+
 # Try intentionally breaking a test
 
 One of the fastest ways to understand TRAM is to intentionally introduce a failure.
